OL,3,CWoman, 23, charged with murder of man
OL,4,Cin Southampton
OL,6,FA 23-year-old woman from Dorset has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with the murder of a 45-
OL,8,Fyear-old man from Southampton.
OL,10,FKatie Linin, of Eldon Place, in
OL,11,FBournemouth has been remanded in
OL,12,Fcustody to appear at Southampton
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday 12
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FThe charge follows the reported
OL,17,Fassault of a man at an address on
OL,18,FWeston Lane, Southampton, at 4.21am on
OL,19,FSunday 9 August.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
