OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786551523
OL,3,CWoman, 23, charged with murder of man
OL,4,Cin Southampton
OL,6,FOfficers attended the property but
OL,7,FCraig Wesley Mintram was pronounced
OL,8,Fdead at the scene.
OL,10,FHis family are being supported by
OL,11,Fspecially trained officers.
OL,13,FA 54-year-old man from Southampton was
OL,14,Falso arrested in connection with the
OL,15,Fincident, but has since been released
OL,16,Ffrom custody, without any further
OL,17,Faction to be taken against him.
